# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:86
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "आमुख"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:88
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kturtle; is an educational programming environment that uses <link "
"linkend=\"what-is-turtlelang\">&turtlescript;</link>, a programming "
"language loosely based on and inspired by &logo;. The goal of &kturtle; is "
"to make programming as easy and accessible as possible. This makes "
"&kturtle; suitable for teaching kids the basics of math, geometry and... "
"programming. One of the main features of &turtlescript; is the ability to "
"translate the commands into the speaking language of the programmer."
msgstr ""
"&amp;kturtle; एकं शैक्षिकं प्रोग्रामिंग वातावरणं भवति यत् उपयोगं करोति<link "
"linkend=\"what-is-turtlelang\"> &amp;कच्छपलिपि;</link> , &amp;logo; इत्यस्य "
"आधारेण प्रेरिता च प्रोग्रामिंगभाषा । लक्ष्यं &amp;kturtle; प्रोग्रामिंग् "
"यथासम्भवं सुलभं सुलभं च कर्तुं भवति। अनेन &amp;kturtle; बालकान् गणितस्य, "
"ज्यामितिस्य,... प्रोग्रामिंगस्य च मूलभूतविषयान् शिक्षितुं उपयुक्तम्। "
"&amp;turtlescript; इत्यस्य मुख्यविशेषतासु अन्यतमम्; प्रोग्रामरस्य "
"वक्तृभाषायां आदेशान् अनुवादयितुं क्षमता अस्ति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:92
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kturtle; is named after <quote>the turtle</quote> that plays a central "
"role in the programming environment. The student will usually instruct the "
"turtle, using the &turtlescript; commands, to make a drawing on <link "
"linkend=\"the-canvas\">the canvas</link>."
msgstr ""
"&amp;kturtle; इति नाम<quote> कच्छपः</quote> यत् प्रोग्रामिंगवातावरणे "
"केन्द्रभूमिकां निर्वहति। छात्रः प्रायः कच्छपं निर्देशयिष्यति, "
"&amp;turtlescript; आदेशाः, रेखाचित्रं कर्तुं<link linkend=\"the-canvas\"> "
"कैनवासः</link> ."

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:95
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "What is &turtlescript;?"
msgstr "&turtlescript; इति किम्?"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:96
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&turtlescript;, the programming language used in &kturtle;, is inspired by "
"the &logo; family of programming languages. The first version of &logo; was "
"created by Seymour Papert of MIT Artificial Intelligence Laboratory in 1967 "
"as an offshoot of the LISP programming language. From then many versions of "
"&logo; have been released. By 1980 &logo; was gaining momentum, with "
"versions for MSX, Commodore, Atari, Apple II and IBM PC systems. These "
"versions were mainly for educational purposes. The MIT is still maintains "
"<ulink url=\"https://el.media.mit.edu/logo-foundation/\">a website on "
"&logo;</ulink> containing a list of several popular implementation of the "
"language."
msgstr ""
"&turtlescript;, &kturtle;, इत्यस्मिन् प्रयुक्ता प्रोग्रामिंगभाषा &logo; "
"प्रोग्रामिंग भाषाणां परिवारः । &logo; LISP प्रोग्रामिंग भाषायाः शाखारूपेण "
"१९६७ तमे वर्षे MIT Artificial Intelligence Laboratory इत्यस्य Seymour "
"Papert इत्यनेन निर्मितम् । ततः परं &logo; मुक्ताः अभवन् । १९८० तमे वर्षे "
"&logo; गतिं प्राप्नोति स्म, MSX, Commodore, Atari, Apple II, IBM PC "
"प्रणालीनां संस्करणैः सह । एते संस्करणाः मुख्यतया शैक्षिकप्रयोजनार्थं आसन् । "
"MIT अद्यापि <ulink "
"url=\"https://el.media.mit.edu/logo-foundation/\">&logo;</ulink> इत्यत्र "
"एकं जालपुटं परिपालयति यस्मिन् भाषायाः अनेकानाम् लोकप्रियानाम् "
"कार्यान्वयनस्य सूची अस्ति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:99
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&turtlescript; shares a feature found in many other implementations of "
"&logo;: the ability to translate the commands to suit the native language "
"of the student. This feature makes it easier for students that have no or "
"little understanding of English to get started. Besides this feature "
"&kturtle; has <link linkend=\"features-of-kturtle\">many other "
"features</link> aimed at easing the students initial experience with "
"programming."
msgstr ""
"&amp;कच्छपलिपि; &amp;logo;: इत्यस्य अन्येषु बह्वीषु कार्यान्वयनेषु प्राप्तं "
"विशेषतां साझां करोति: छात्रस्य मूलभाषायाः अनुकूलतया आदेशानां अनुवादस्य "
"क्षमता । एतत् विशेषता तेषां छात्राणां कृते आरम्भं कर्तुं सुकरं करोति येषां "
"आङ्ग्लभाषायाः अवगमनं नास्ति वा अल्पं वा भवति। अस्य विशेषतायाः अतिरिक्तं "
"&amp;kturtle; वा<link linkend=\"features-of-kturtle\"> अन्ये बहवः "
"विशेषताः</link> छात्राणां प्रोग्रामिंग् इत्यनेन सह प्रारम्भिकानुभवं सुलभं "
"कर्तुं उद्दिश्यते।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:104
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Features of &kturtle;"
msgstr "&kturtle इत्यस्य विशेषताः;"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:105
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kturtle; has some nice features that make starting to program a breeze. "
"See here some of the highlights of &kturtle; feature set:"
msgstr ""
"&kturtle; केचन सुन्दराः विशेषताः सन्ति येन प्रोग्राम् आरम्भं वायुः भवति । "
"अत्र पश्यन्तु &kturtle; विशेषतासमूहः : १."

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:107
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An integrated environment with &turtlescript; interpreter, <link "
"linkend=\"the-editor\">editor</link>, <link "
"linkend=\"the-canvas\">canvas</link> and other tools all in one application "
"(no extra dependencies)."
msgstr ""
"&amp;turtlescript; व्याख्याता,<link linkend=\"the-editor\"> सम्पादक</link> "
", ९.<link linkend=\"the-canvas\"> कैनवासः</link> अन्ये च साधनानि सर्वाणि "
"एकस्मिन् अनुप्रयोगे (अतिरिक्तनिर्भरता नास्ति)।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:108
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The ability to translate the &turtlescript; commands using the translation "
"framework of &kde;."
msgstr ""
"अनुवादस्य क्षमता &turtlescript; &kde; इत्यस्य अनुवादरूपरेखायाः उपयोगेन "
"आदेशाः ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:109
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&turtlescript; supports user defined functions, recursion and dynamic type "
"switching."
msgstr ""
"&कच्छपलिपि; उपयोक्तृनिर्धारितकार्यं, पुनरावृत्तिः, गतिशीलप्रकारस्य "
"स्विचिंग् च समर्थयति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:110
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "The execution can be slowed down, paused or stopped at any time."
msgstr "निष्पादनं कदापि मन्दं कर्तुं, विरामं कर्तुं, स्थगितुं वा शक्यते ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:111
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A powerful <link linkend=\"the-editor\">editor</link> featuring intuitive "
"syntax highlighting, line numbering, error markers, visual execution and "
"more."
msgstr ""
"एकः शक्तिशाली<link linkend=\"the-editor\"> सम्पादक</link> सहजज्ञानयुक्तं "
"वाक्यविन्यासप्रकाशनं, रेखासङ्ख्याकरणं, त्रुटिचिह्नानि, दृश्यनिष्पादनं "
"इत्यादीनि सन्ति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:112
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <link linkend=\"the-canvas\">canvas</link>, where the turtle draws, can "
"be printed or saved either as an image (PNG) or a drawing (&SVG;)."
msgstr ""
"द<link linkend=\"the-canvas\"> कैनवासः</link> , यत्र कच्छपः आकर्षयति, तत्र "
"चित्ररूपेण (PNG) अथवा रेखाचित्ररूपेण (&amp;SVG;) मुद्रयितुं वा रक्षितुं वा "
"शक्यते ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:113
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Context help: help where you need it. Just press <keysym>F2</keysym> (or "
"see <menuchoice><guimenu>Help</guimenu><guimenuitem>Help on: "
"...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>) to get help on the piece of code currently "
"under your cursor."
msgstr ""
"सन्दर्भसहायता : यत्र भवतः आवश्यकता अस्ति तत्र सहायता। केवलं "
"<keysym>F2</keysym> नुदन्तु (अथवा "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>सहायता</guimenu><guimenuitem>सहायता पश्यन्तु: "
"...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>) कोडस्य खण्डे सहायतां प्राप्तुं सम्प्रति "
"भवतः कर्सरस्य अधः ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:114
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An error dialog that links the error messages to the mistakes in the "
"program and marks them red."
msgstr ""
"एकः त्रुटिसंवादः यः त्रुटिसन्देशान् कार्यक्रमे त्रुटिभिः सह सम्बध्दयति तथा "
"च तान् रक्तवर्णेन चिह्नयति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:115
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Simplified programming terminology."
msgstr "सरलीकृत प्रोग्रामिंग शब्दावली।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:116
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Integrated example programs to make it easy to get started. These examples "
"are translated using &kde; translation framework."
msgstr ""
"आरम्भं सुलभं कर्तुं एकीकृतानि उदाहरणकार्यक्रमाः। एतानि उदाहरणानि &kde; "
"अनुवादरूपरेखा।"

